This task involves implementing the layout constraint system for CycoTui, which provides a flexible, constraint-based approach for arranging UI elements in the terminal. Based on analysis of Ratatui's layout implementation, this task will create the core rectangle representation, constraint system, and layout algorithm needed for positioning UI elements.

